    description: "Found by the 2026-11-24 docstring staleness audit (dev 7e204b35b): a reviewer flagged it and a default-REJECT verifier re-reproduced it on a fixture of its own (reports under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/staleness_audit_11242026/review and verify). Corpus impact not measured. Of 18 with-statement shapes run through the real Python CFG and py_def_use, `with open(x) as d[k]:` and `with open(x) as fh.a[k]:` miss the read of k. Because cfg.unaccounted_names keys statements by node_type (WI-vakog) and uncovered_semantic_lines is also empty, neither completeness gate reports it. r21, v06."  # e7b2
